  "narrative": {
    "ablation_narrative": "Removing plus_dp produces the largest single degradation in accuracy (-0.2901 relative to the complete framework, which reaches 0.9088). Ranked by the size of the effect, the changes in accuracy on removing each component are: plus_dp (-0.2901), the FedProx proximal term (-0.0123), the anomaly filter (+0.0000), the reinforcement-learning controller (+0.0002), gradient compression (+0.0045), adversarial training (+0.0219). Components whose removal improves raw accuracy are retained because they purchase a property that accuracy does not measure: differential privacy provides the formal guarantee of Table 6, and gradient compression reduces uplink volume by 89.1%.",
    "mechanism_note": "The ablation attributes the advantage over static aggregation principally to plus_dp, rather than to the combination as a whole.",
    "attack_narrative": "Under evasion attack the adversarially trained model retains 0.735 accuracy against FGSM and 0.700 against 10-step PGD at a perturbation budget of 0.03, against 0.911 on clean data. whereas the same model trained without adversarial examples falls to 0.368 under the identical FGSM attack. With two sign-flipping hospitals, the proposed defences hold accuracy at 0.791 against 0.297 when norm clipping, trimmed-mean aggregation and the anomaly filter are disabled. With three label-flipping hospitals, the proposed defences hold accuracy at 0.882 against 0.882 when norm clipping, trimmed-mean aggregation and the anomaly filter are disabled.",
    "smallcohort_narrative": "The determining factor is the number of images each institution holds, because it sets the subsampling rate and therefore how cheaply the budget composes over local steps. Holding the noise multiplier at 1.5 and the schedule fixed, and varying only the per-hospital sample count, the accounted worst-case budget moves from 57.6 at roughly a fifth of our cohort size to 7.7 at seven times it. A federation of ten institutions the size of ours therefore cannot reach a single-digit budget at useful accuracy however the mechanism is tuned, whereas the same mechanism on a cohort several times larger can. We state this because it bounds what any differentially private cross-silo framework of this scale can claim, independently of the particular architecture used."
  }
